t, then add the smallest step the equipment allows. Adding repetitions or adding weight both work.","If you can do 1–2 repetitions more than the planned number, increase the load by about 2–10%.","Log every set with its repetitions in reserve. If performance drops for two sessions in a row, or you feel run down, take the lighter week early.","Rebuild the plan every 6–8 weeks, or sooner if your goal, schedule, equipment or health changes."],"cardio":[{"mode":"walking","label":"Brisk or incline walking — intervals","minutes":25,"intensity":"vigorous","exerciseId":"startfit:brisk-walking","weekday":0,"note":"After an easy warm-up, alternate about 1 minute hard with 2 minutes easy; start with 4–6 rounds (StartFit starting point, not a study protocol)."},{"mode":"walking","label":"Brisk or incline walking","minutes":40,"intensity":"moderate","exerciseId":"startfit:brisk-walking","weekday":1,"note":"Moderate effort: you can talk but not sing."},{"mode":"walking","label":"Brisk or incline walking","minutes":40,"intensity":"moderate","exerciseId":"startfit:brisk-walking","weekday":3,"note":"Moderate effort: you can talk but not sing."},{"mode":"walking","label":"Brisk or incline walking","minutes":40,"intensity":"moderate","exerciseId":"startfit:brisk-walking","weekday":5,"note":"Moderate effort: you can talk but not sing."},{"mode":"walking","label":"Brisk or incline walking","minutes":40,"intensity":"moderate","exerciseId":"startfit:brisk-walking","weekday":6,"note":"Moderate effort: you can talk but not sing."}],"cardioMinutesPerWeek":185,"cardioTargetMinutes":200,"cardioRamp":[200,200,200,200,200,200],"notes":[],"claimIds":["acsm_days","vol_fractional","vol_dose","vol_session_cap","vol_targets_design","exercise_order","warmup","load_range","failure_optional","failure_proximity","rir_start_easier","rir_scale","rest_intervals","freq_hypertrophy","progress_both","progress_increase","deload_concept","deload_rule","who_activity","hiit_time","concurrent","rt_body_fat"],"ratio